Third-party material
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository contains NO Garmin source code, SDK files, documentation text,
device images, or other Garmin-owned material.

ciqkit interoperates with the Garmin Connect IQ SDK, which you install yourself
from Garmin and which remains subject to Garmin's own licence terms. In
particular:

  * tools/sdk-mcp does not ship Garmin's API documentation. It ships a PARSER
    that reads the SDK documentation already installed on your machine and
    writes a local index, which never leaves your machine.

  * The device frames used when rendering a "watch with strap" screenshot are
    read at runtime from the device images in your own SDK installation. None
    are redistributed here.

